WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.237 --> 00:00:03.818
NARRATOR: Gotham, a city beset
by ceaseless criminal chaos.

00:00:03.818 --> 00:00:05.461
-(PERSON GROANS)
-(SIRENS WAIL)

00:00:05.461 --> 00:00:08.503
NARRATOR: But what happens
when a shadow steps out
of the darkness?

00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:09.427
(WHIP CRACKS)

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:10.933
BATMAN: What's the situation,
Commissioner?

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:12.810
COMMISSIONER GORDON:
Argh! Sweet bride of Joseph!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.071
NARRATOR:
Batman: The Audio Adventures.

00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:17.615
Ten chapters
of serialized mayhem.

00:00:17.665 --> 00:00:19.208
SELINA KYLE: Just a single girl
and her cats

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:20.680
-living alone, after all.
-(JOKER CACKLES)

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.605
THE RIDDLER: Don't freakin'
interrupt me when I'm riddling!

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.974
NARRATOR: Listen to
Batman: The Audio Adventures,

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:29.944
streaming only on HBO Max
starting September 18th.

